#!/usr/bin/env python
"""
Fact-checker (The Auditors) â€” Deep Research 2.0
================================================
Kisi bhi generated research report ko uske source documents ke against check karta hai:

  1. RAGAS Faithfulness  â€” report ke claims kitne % source text se supported hain
                           (hallucination / "apni taraf se jodna" pakadta hai)
  2. Prometheus-style LLM Judge â€” rubric-based critic jo specific galtiyan,
                           missing facts aur contradictions list karta hai

Dono checks aapke FREE LLM endpoint (z.ai / NaraRouter) par chalte hain â€”
bas .env wali hi keys/settings use hoti hain.

Setup:
    pip install -r requirements-free.txt

Use:
    python scripts/fact-check.py report.md --sources source1.txt source2.md
    python scripts/fact-check.py report.md --sources-dir output/sources/

Note: evaluation LLM ko report + sources kaafi text padhna padta hai, isliye
free tier par thoda time lag sakta hai.
"""

